  "body_html": "<p>Bring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with this stunning Jeminise Cactus &amp; Floral Printed Quilt Set. Featuring a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, this quilt set is perfect for adding a touch of nature-inspired elegance and personalized charm to your bedroom decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Cactus &amp; Floral Design:</strong> Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors to add a pop of nature-inspired beauty to any bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size or adding pillowcases and custom text.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102''x91\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A unique and thoughtful gift for cactus lovers, home décor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates vibrant and cheerful bedding.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable for easy cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort &amp; Warmth:</strong> The outer layer is made of breathable soft fabric, and the filling material is high-quality silk floss, providing comfort for all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Can be used as a bed quilt, a picnic mat, or a throw blanket, suitable for various indoor and outdoor settings.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cactus, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Cactus, Desert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Style #2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102''x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
